1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:05,500
In a small kitchen, a girl was learning to bake injera.

2
00:00:07,299 --> 00:00:12,220
Her first injera tore. So did the second.

3
00:00:14,300 --> 00:00:20,380
The third one burned. The girl lost hope and wanted to quit.

4
00:00:21,300 --> 00:00:26,410
Her mother said nothing. She took an egg from the basket.

5
00:00:28,300 --> 00:00:31,030
Slowly, slowly, an egg walks on its own legs.

6
00:00:35,299 --> 00:00:36,469
she said.

7
00:00:38,299 --> 00:00:43,639
Days passed, then weeks. Every day, the girl tried again and again.

8
00:00:46,299 --> 00:00:50,359
One morning, the injera came out round and soft.

9
00:00:52,299 --> 00:00:55,559
Slowly, slowly, the egg had walked.
